BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bampot Presents CARNIVAL FAIRy: a queer fairy party
DTSTART:20261024T210000
DTEND:20261024T210000
UID:7ae277557be740baac876b561df3b18c@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Our quarterly queer fae party returns\, this time bringing an 
 otherworldly circus with it. When the crowds go away\, the fae come out to
  play. The autumn carnival is closing down for the night. Patrons have all
  filed out. But - what’s that? The lights are blinking back on\, the rid
 es creaking back to life. Who could it be? Well\, it’s the fairies of co
 urse! When everyone else has packed it in for the night\, our favourite fa
 e folk emerge to party all night at the carnival. Join them at the fae fai
 r for an evening of DJs\, dancing\, body painting\, sideshow performance\,
  fortune telling\, clowning and more! In the front\, we will have dancing\
 , carnival games and sideshow performances throughout the night. In the ba
 ck\, the fairy market will provide you with many wares to peruse\, tarot a
 nd fortune telling\, body painting\, and many other fae delights. As alway
 s\, there WILL be a costume contest\, so bring out your best carnivalesque
  fae. Give me a fairy acrobat\, a pierrot pixie\, a spritely stilt walker.
  Get silly with it! Come on out to dance the night away with the fae 🧚 
 ‍
LOCATION:Bampot\, 201 Harbord St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/bampot-presents-carnival-fairy-a-queer-fai
 ry-party
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
