BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cooking Class &amp\; Drag: SEA FRIENDS Halloween event!
DTSTART:20261025T150000
DTEND:20261025T150000
UID:c0fad8db231c7a7e33b83cc086847162@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:A unique way to get into the Halloween spirit while celebratin
 g Southeast Asian culture through a cooking class and drag with SEA FRIEND
 S! Be immersed in Southeast Asian culture by joining SEA FRIENDS at Mengra
 i Thai for delicious Thai food and a special drag performance by Aria Doll
 ! Your ticket includes a meal\, cooking class\, and performance by Aria Do
 ll. Tax and tip already included in ticket price! Please see the Agenda fo
 r full details. Please let us know if you require a vegan option or have a
 ny allergies or dietary restrictions. Chef Sasi 🇹🇭 (Sasi Meechai-Lim
 ) is an award-winning\, Iron Chef-winning Thai chef\, co-owner of the accl
 aimed Mengrai Thai restaurant in Toronto\, Ontario\, and started Treetop C
 ountry Volunteer Charity in Thailand. Aria Doll 🇰🇭 is the dancing As
 ian princess of London Ontario serving you tricks\, beauty\, and fashion. 
 She has performed for amazing headliners such as Kim Chi\, Brooke Lynn Hyt
 es\, Miz Cracker\, Priyanka\, Lemon and more. Her aesthetic is described a
 s elegance with an edge. They were featured on season 2 of OUT tv’s “C
 all Me Mother.” SEA FRIENDS is a Toronto-based creative collective and e
 vent series aimed to uplift Southeast Asian culture through celebration\, 
 dialogue\, and exchange. SEA FRIENDS invites everyone to engage with the r
 ichness\, vibrancy\, and diversity of Southeast Asian culture. Alongside a
  growing network of collaborators\, the collective is led by Mars 🇮🇩
 \, Patricia 🇵🇭 and Tim 🇱🇦. ‍
LOCATION:Mengrai Thai\, 82 Ontario St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/cooking-class-drag-sea-friends-halloween-e
 vent
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
