 getting a little rougher at The Drink this month! 😈🔥 Join us Sunday\
 , October 25th\, for another edition of KINKED\, an evening of fetish\, ex
 ploration\, and kinky fun! 🐾 Hosted by King Kobe\, with special guest S
 urr\, who&#x27\;s bringing an **IMPACT PLAY DEMO** to the party! 💥 Whet
 her you&#x27\;re a seasoned kinkster or just curious about exploring somet
 hing new\, KINKED is all about creating a welcoming space to connect\, lea
 rn\, and indulge your kinky side. Consent\, respect\, and a little mischie
 f are always encouraged. 🖤 🔥 **DRINK SPECIALS** 🥃 $5 Fireball 
 🍹 $6 Bar Rail 🍺 $7 Blonde Ale ⛓️ Dark Room 💥 Live Impact Play
  Demo 🐾 Fetish-Friendly Vibes 📍 The Drink – 459 Church Street 📅
  Sunday\, October 25 🕔 5 PM – 10 PM NO COVER Come dressed to express 
 yourself\, bring your curiosity\, and let&#x27\;s get KINKED! 😈 Present
 ed with The Men&#x27\;s Room Toronto ❤️🖤 #KINKED #KingKobe #Toronto
 Kink #QueerToronto #FetishCommunity ‍
LOCATION:The Drink\, 459 Church Street 2nd floor
