BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:4th Annual Queersgiving
DTSTART:20261025T190000
DTEND:20261025T190000
UID:5d7950405687e375b5a35a87d057b53e@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Queersgiving is back for Year 4! Queersgiving is an annual\, c
 ompletely free community dinner bringing 2SLGBTQ+ folks together over good
  food\, meaningful conversations\, and chosen family. Now in its fourth ye
 ar\, Queersgiving was created with a simple belief: everyone deserves some
 where to belong\, a warm meal to enjoy\, and a community that shows up for
  them. Over the past three years\, we&#x27\;ve served more than 500 member
 s of our community\, creating a space where strangers become friends\, fri
 ends become family\, and everyone is welcome at the table. Want to support
  Queersgiving? You can make a donation that will go towards food and venue
  costs. Every contribution helps us keep this dinner free and accessible f
 or our community. Whether you’ve joined us before or this is your first 
 time\, Queersgiving is for everyone! ‍
LOCATION:TBA\, Address TO BE ANNOUNCED
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/4th-annual-queersgiving
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
