SUMMARY:A Girl Walks Home Alone At Night + Iranian Genre Shorts Program
DTSTART:20261028T183000
DTEND:20261028T183000
UID:e90cad84bc2dc2067bb5cc3b248477ef@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Rangarang World presents Ana Lily Amirpour’s acclaimed debut
 \, A Girl Walks Home Alone at Night (2014). In the Iranian ghost town of B
 ad City\, a lonely vampire stalks the streets in this striking black-and-w
 hite blend of horror\, romance and western. The screening is preceded by a
  curated program of Iranian short films spanning horror\, fantasy and anim
 ation: Mother Clay - Armin Rangani\, Raha Amirfazli Home Wrecker - Avin Ha
 masian The Old Young Crow - Liam LoPinto Dancing Heart - Negar Movaghatian
  Starver - Parsa Zahedi More to be announced. ‍
LOCATION:Innis Town Hall\, 2 Sussex Ave
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/a-girl-walks-home-alone-at-night-iranian-g
 enre-shorts-program
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
