BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:¡A CENAAAR! An immersive Día de los Muertos dinner experience by
  machaa
DTSTART:20261029T190000
DTEND:20261029T190000
UID:68bd51afff5844700838d50f8827fcaf@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Step into 1940s Mexico for one night only. 30 seats\, music\, 
 theatre and the soul of a celebration. Bring a photo of someone you miss. 
 One night. One table. One house where the past comes to dinner. There’s 
 a house in Toronto that opens its doors just once a year. When you knock\,
  the host opens the door because they’ve been expecting you. Inside\, bo
 leros fill the room. Candlelight flickers against marigolds. An altar wait
 s for you to make it your own and honour someone who has passed\, someone 
 who will dine with us tonight. A long table is set\, and your seat is wait
 ing. Stories find their way to your eyes and ears. Characters live the nig
 ht beside you. Music drifts through the room. And somewhere between dinner
 \, theatre and memory\, you become part of the story. Welcome to the bohem
 ian Mexico of the 1940s\, inspired by the Golden Age of Mexican cinema\, t
 he intellectuals\, surrealists and muralists of an era defined by art\, im
 agination and exploration. ¡A Cenaaar! lives somewhere between a film and
  a dream. A night to dance\, remember\, and celebrate the past and the pre
 sent. There is no stage. No audience. No fourth wall. Come hungry. Bring a
  photo of someone you miss. Tonight\, no one dines alone. (FOR MORE INFO S
 EE THE TICKET LINK PROVIDED)
LOCATION:Foy House\, 92 Isabella St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/a-cenaaar-an-immersive-dia-de-los-muertos-
 dinner-experience-by-machaa
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
