DESCRIPTION:Live deliciously at an exclusive Sapphic Play Party. Don&#x27\
 ;t you want to live deliciously? Welcome to the Witch’s Frenzy – a nig
 ht of playing\, dancing and honouring the witches that came before us. Thi
 s is a play party exclusively for women\, trans\, non-binary\, and two-spi
 rit folx. You do not have to identify as “sapphic” if it does not fit\
 ; the only limitation on attendance is that cis men are not permitted in t
 he space. CIS MEN ARE NOT PERMITTED TO ATTEND THIS EVENT. We have more eve
 nts coming up that will be open to everyone! Follow @salemburnsevents to s
 tay up to date. Come adorned in your witchy best\, as a famous witch from 
 pop culture\, literature\, history or as your own version of the witches g
 lory. We are so honoured to be partnering with the legendary @threedollarb
 ill.parkdale for this sapphic play party . Join us in the witches cottage\
 , in the forest under the moonlight\, let your spells be heard by the wind
 . Lounge with your fellow sapphic witches and cast a spell together. A nig
 ht of: Sapphic Play Dance DJs Performances Lounge Space Dungeon Limited ca
 pacity so get your tickets now! This is an exclusive event and tickets WIL
 L sell out. There will be NO TIX AT THE DOOR. Dungeon and play space rules
  will be in effect. Play is permitted but no penetration (the townsfolk go
 vernance have a very limited view on queer/sapphic play). No scat\, no blo
 od\, no watersports\, no CNC\, no wax. The rules of all our parties are gi
 ven at the door. Consent rules will be enforced everywhere in the space. D
 Ms and Vibe Patrol will be enforcing rules\, monitoring substance intake a
 nd monitoring behaviour. We have a ZERO tolerance policy for defying these
  guidelines - one strike and you’re out. ‍
