 --------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ------------- If you are wearing a costume\, come inspired by the iconic p
 op culture references. This night is about honouring the queens\, kings\, 
 and iconic duos who&#x27\;ve shaped our memories and upbringing - complete
  with a fun\, dive showdown to show the Third ever MissYaTabTab. As always
 \, expect a night of non-stop dancing with Arabic pop throwbacks\, wedding
  anthems\, and street festival hits curated by resident DJ Rami Nassif. --
