 usive space where our people and community can express themselves freely. 
 There&#x27\;s a zero tolerance policy for racism\, sexism\, homophobia\, q
 ueerphobia\, transphobia\, harrassment\, and any other conduct that may pe
 rpetuate oppression. Anyone violating this will be asked to leave immediat
 ely. REFUND POLICY No refunds after 24 hours. PLEASE NOTE This is a closed
  private event accessible only to ticket holders. All attendees must be 19
 + with a valid government ID for admission. ‍
