DESCRIPTION:Spacetime Halloween Saturday October 31\, 2026 Spacetime Dave 
 and team are excited to host this year’s annual Halloween debacle at the
  legendary halls of the Lithuanian House on Bloor St West!!! Event theme a
 nd details are still swirling in space and will blast off next week. Grab 
 a discount pre-sale and get on board - limited Blind faith and Early Bird 
 tickets are now up. Event details: This all happens at the downtown Lithua
 nian House complex. Towering ceilings\, old creaky halls and stairs\, frie
 ndly nooks to lose or find yourself - the perfect place to loop all the lo
 cal galaxies together! Art and party stuff: 2 rooms of Funktion One sound 
 Lazers and lighting Spacetime stage build UV Slinky world Photo booth Gogo
  dancer Seating chill areas Medic onsite $30 plus HST Blind Faith $40 plus
  HST Early Bird $50 plus HST Regular 9pm-3am THE SPACETIME PARTY ETHOS: Ev
 ery Spacetime gathering is a rare meeting point — one moment\, one place
 \, shared by everyone who shows up. We’re here together in this slice of
  time\, so be good to each other - always care\, patience\, and respect. M
 ove with awareness\, ask for consent\, and allow people their space to dan
 ce and to be. If cost or accessibility is standing in your way\, email loo
 p@spacetimexo.com — we’ll make sure you can join us. Our harm reductio
 n monitors and crew are present all night to support anyone who needs a ha
 nd. Let’s take care of the space\, the time\, and each other. See you ou
 t there:) ‍
LOCATION:Lithuanian House\, 1573 Bloor St W
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/spacetime-halloween-annual
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
