DTSTART:20261031T210000
DTEND:20261031T210000
UID:be03826486ac3fc100fbcdf5e3a558ab@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:THREE YEARS. ONE MISSING DRAG FAMILY... Welcome to HOUSE OF BI
 LLS\, a small-town fabric store where dance moms bought sequins\, grandmas
  bought yarn and the local drag performers discreetly cleared out the frin
 ge &amp\; sequins The manager ran the cutting counter by day and mothered 
 the underground drag scene by night. Then she was murdered. The staff and 
 her queens\, kings &amp\; things disappeared. The doors closed. And nobody
  ever cracked the case\, until now. This Halloween\, you’re invited insi
 de. Join our true-crime podcast host for an evening of drag performances\,
  90s dance vibes\, tarot readings and the ghosts that haunt this house. Co
 me dance\, investigate and celebrate THREE YEARS of Three Dollar Bill and 
 the big queer little world we’ve built together. Drop in any time throug
 hout the night. The queer dead are notoriously bad at sticking to a schedu
 le. Saturday\, October 31 9pm-2am $20 ‍
LOCATION:Three Dollar Bill\, 1592 Queen Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/house-of-bills---three-year-anniversary
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
