BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:PRNCPTL DOES TORONTO (Halloween Night)
DTSTART:20261031T220000
DTEND:20261031T220000
UID:fbe0d72339b0262b5031d1d63d4939db@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Berlin based art &amp\; music collective Pornceptual brings th
 eir iconic kink-forward party series to Toronto for a dark and sexy Hallow
 een night debut! Step into the shadows where relentless techno meets unbri
 dled erotic liberation. Pornceptual is an evening of uncompromising sounds
 capes\, visceral performance art\, and skin-on-skin connection. Forged in 
 the same radical queer spirit that birthed WHOLE Festival\, this isn&#x27\
 ;t just another party... it’s a living canvas of body autonomy\, dark be
 ats\, and communal euphoria. Leave expectations at the door\, shed your ar
 mor\, and lose yourself on the dance floor! FEATURING SPIKEY LEE (PRNCPTL 
 RESIDENT) VINVAR (PRNCPTL RESIDENT) KARIM OLEN ASH (NYC) DRESS CODE PRNCPT
 L is not an everyday space\, and we don’t want you to dress like it is. 
 Fetish. Sexy. Dress up. Dress down. Get naked. Transform yourself. Leather
 \, latex\, PVC\, mesh\, harnesses\, lingerie\, underwear\, uniforms\, cost
 umes\, bodywear\, extravagant looks\, barely anything at all or something 
 completely your own. There is no single PRNCPTL uniform. What matters is t
 hat your look feels intentional and that you have made an effort to step o
 utside your everyday self. What doesn’t work: Jeans\, regular T-shirts\,
  casual streetwear\, everyday sportswear and basic looks you could wear to
  any bar or club. You do not need expensive fetish-wear or a specific bran
 d to get in. Creativity\, confidence and intention matter much more. Dress
  for the space you are entering\, not for the street you came from. ‍
LOCATION:Complex19\, 19 Toronto St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/prncptl-does-toronto-halloween-night
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
