DESCRIPTION:Ella Mayo is back at Cake to present DOLLS 3: VENUS\, A Trans-
 Femme Showcase. Welcome to the land of DOLLS\, an euphoric celebration of 
 the power of trans femininity\, explored the lenses of drag and cabaret pe
 rformance. This show was created specifically for The Dolls and those who 
 love them! After two sold out shows\, Ella is bringing back the DOLLS with
  an all new VENUS edition of the iconic show. Featuring an all-star cast o
 f transgender divas and trans femme icons\, prepare yourself for a night o
 f jaw-dropping stunts\, breathtaking beauty and divine transfemininity tha
 t will leave you worshipping on your hands and knees. DOLLS was created in
  response to the lack of representation for trans girls and femmes within 
 trans and gender diverse space in Toronto. So\, these sisters are doing it
  for themselves! From upcoming icons to true living legends\, these Devast
 atingly Opulent Local Ladies Serving will sweep you off your feet and tran
 sport you to the magical land of the DOLLS. Prepare yourself for the upcom
 ing cast reveal and get ready to GAG. ONE NIGHT ONLY - Friday\, November 1
 3th at 8pm Don&#x27\;t miss your chance to Support\, Uplift and Pay the Do
 lls\, while witnessing their incredible talents at this iconic debut event
 . Show 8:00\, Door 7:00. 19+ ‍
LOCATION:Cake Cabaret\, 627 Danforth Ave
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/dolls-3-venus
